{"4556620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Somnara", "steam_appid": 4556620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Somnara is a dream-driven exploration experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You move through a sequence of surreal environments, each shaped by a different feeling. Fear, calm, nostalgia, or something harder to define.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no monsters or jumpscares <br>Instead, the world itself shifts in subtle and unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556620/extras/4857bd5bf16fc5b8e8137a7403a054b1.poster.avif?t=1779884914\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556620/extras/4857bd5bf16fc5b8e8137a7403a054b1.webm?t=1779884914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556620/extras/4857bd5bf16fc5b8e8137a7403a054b1.mp4?t=1779884914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From dark, enclosed spaces to bright, almost peaceful environments, each level contrasts the one before it, creating a constantly evolving experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive, atmosphere-focused exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat, no enemies, no jumpscares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple distinct environments with unique moods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle environmental changes and sound-based tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear progression through interconnected dream-like spaces.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556620/extras/553297f6fec50fa5c46f57832221839f.poster.avif?t=1779884914\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556620/extras/553297f6fec50fa5c46f57832221839f.webm?t=1779884914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556620/extras/553297f6fec50fa5c46f57832221839f.mp4?t=1779884914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Somnara is a dream-driven exploration experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You move through a sequence of surreal environments, each shaped by a different feeling. Fear, calm, nostalgia, or something harder to define.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no monsters or jumpscares <br>Instead, the world itself shifts in subtle and unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556620/extras/4857bd5bf16fc5b8e8137a7403a054b1.poster.avif?t=1779884914\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556620/extras/4857bd5bf16fc5b8e8137a7403a054b1.webm?t=1779884914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556620/extras/4857bd5bf16fc5b8e8137a7403a054b1.mp4?t=1779884914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From dark, enclosed spaces to bright, almost peaceful environments, each level contrasts the one before it, creating a constantly evolving experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive, atmosphere-focused exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat, no enemies, no jumpscares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple distinct environments with unique moods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle environmental changes and sound-based tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear progression through interconnected dream-like spaces.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556620/extras/553297f6fec50fa5c46f57832221839f.poster.avif?t=1779884914\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556620/extras/553297f6fec50fa5c46f57832221839f.webm?t=1779884914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556620/extras/553297f6fec50fa5c46f57832221839f.mp4?t=1779884914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Somnara is a psychological dream experience focused on atmosphere and exploration. No monsters, no jumpscares, just strange environments that shift, distort, and feel increasingly wrong.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556620/6d4905d15da62b70d565853949290314c25a8f81/header.jpg?t=1779884914", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556620/6f7501e07d5e7a88aca3f62e76e68c5f118ca20a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779884914", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556620/6f7501e07d5e7a88aca3f62e76e68c5f118ca20a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779884914", "website": 